Short:        A safe "sprintf" function using RawDoFmt().
Author:       d93-hyo@nada.kth.se (Lorens Younes)
Uploader:     d93-hyo nada kth se (Lorens Younes)
Type:         dev/src
Version:      1.0
Requires:     SAS/C 6.56, GNU make 3.74 and exec.library V37.
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

Utility functions for handling format strings. Includes a safe
"sprintf" function that won't cause buffer overflow.
